    "description": "<p>When you first acquire this Skill, choose a wheels type: <strong>Bike</strong>, <strong>Board</strong>, or <strong>Blades</strong>. You gain its <strong>basic benefits</strong>. If you take this skill at character creation, you begin play with a <strong>set</strong> of <strong>wheels</strong> of your choice.</p><p>Whenever you take this Skill again, choose one option: you gain the <strong>basic benefits</strong> of a new wheels type; <strong>or</strong> you gain the <strong>advanced benefits</strong> of a wheels type whose <strong>basic benefits</strong> you already obtained; or you gain the <strong>superior benefits</strong> of a wheels type whose <strong>advanced benefits</strong> you already obtained.</p>",
